Package: pi-console
Version: 1.0.4
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), nginx, nut, nut-client
Maintainer: Gonzalo Valenzuela <gonzalo@rave.cl>
Description: Pi Console — Homelab dashboard
 Self-hosted homelab dashboard for Raspberry Pi with modules:
 WOL Console, NUT Monitor, Net Monitor, Proxmox Monitor, Admin Panel.
 Served via nginx reverse proxy with shared SSO authentication.
 Author: Gonzalo Valenzuela <gonzalo@rave.cl>
